  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Federal Roads Decentralization Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Decentralizacin Carreteras Federales</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM HAS THE GENERAL OBJECTIVE OF REDUCING THE &quot;CUSTO BRASIL&quot; THROUGH REHABILITATION OF APPROXIMATELY 13,000 KMS OF ROADS DURING A FOUR-YEAR PERIOD, OF WHICH THE PROPOSED OPERATION WILL BE THE FIRST PHASE; AS PART OF THE PROGRAM, PART OF THESE ROADS WILL BE TRANSFERRED TO THE JURISDICTION OF THE STATES IN WHICH THEY ARE LOCATED.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
